when we set out to reboot Gauntlet we  wanted to recapture the fun and  excitement of the 1980s original arcade  classic like the original arcade game  this rebirth is a four-player  cooperative dungeon crawler involving  four distinct heroes like the classic we  have Thor the warrior armed with an axe  he uses brutal close-range melee strikes  including a spinning attack that turns  him into a whirling tornado of death  Thyra the Valkyrie is armed with a spear  for frontal charges as well as a shield  that blocks assaults and becomes a  destructive boomerang and thrown quest  or the elf is precise in his strike and  can release a volley of arrows and drop  tactical bombs the elf can also utilize  a rolling tumble to quickly dodge  attacks and traps and Merlin the wizard  who has a variety of magic attacks to  choose from he can blast his adversaries  with many spells including comets of  molten lava shards of ice and arcing  bolts of Chain Lightning some abilities  can even be upgraded through perks for  example quest doors bombs can be  upgraded and attached to arrows  siress shield can be improved to reflect  enemy fire  in the backstory of gauntlet a young  wizard morroc conjures the gauntlet  seeking glory he is instead trapped  within its depths using wizardry he  calls on heroes and convinces them to  enter the gauntlet and set him free  gauntlet consists of environments like  dusty crypts dark caves fiery dungeons  and each environment has multiple styles  of gameplay some dungeon maps are hand  crafted experiences with secrets to  discover while other levels are  procedurally generated with death itself  chasing players through an unpredictable  labyrinth there are also endurance maps  filled with wave after wave of monsters  to survive inside gauntlet players will  be able to buy new armor and weapons  with the gold they acquire during  gameplay even more exciting is the  ability to unlock relics relics aware  the big powers like use a mirror relic  to create a magic army to fight in the  battle there are relics to freeze your  enemies blow them away in a tornado set  them on fire increase speed and many  more regardless of your skill level  there are thousands of ways to die in  the gauntlet to survive seek delicious  roast turkey to restore health how will  you die hordes of monsters in mortal den  devious traps or bone crushing bosses  perhaps the biggest threat your face  could be your friends competing for food  and gold beside you you're probably  going to get your fellow heroes killed  accidentally or not but that's okay  Corbett you actually get perks for dying  you'll be able to show off your status  with the leaderboards ranking your kills  loot from the fastest time replay the  Borden's treat your own scores at higher  difficulty settings September 23rd  invade the gauntlet and fight for glory  treasure and succulent turkey  you
 

